  "id": "munchausen-syndrome-by-proxy",
  "term": "Münchausen syndrome by proxy",
  "definition": "Münchausen syndrome by proxy is a form of child abuse in which someone other than the patient, usually a parent, makes up illness symptoms and brings the child for medical care. This can lead to unnecessary and often painful examinations and treatments.",
